      50.64,
      387.67,
      286.45,
      669.2
    ],
    "text": "Reference No.: 3/7/16/6. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/4/2015/LO/183. I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose :- Description of the land or servitude to be acquired : Two (02) allotments of land called Wewathenna in total extent about 0.1099 Hectare shown as Lot Numbers 561,562 in the Sheet No. 8 of Supplement No. 8 of the Final Village Plan No. 266 dated 28.11.2018 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Amban Ella in Grama Niladhari Division No. 523 B Wewathenna, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Walapane in Nuwara Eliya District of the Central province and described as follows:- 01. Lot No. 561 Name of the Land: Wewathenna; Claimants: State; Original Claimants: National Housing Development Authority; Land Use: Home Garden, Part of a Permanent Building; Extent : 0.0025 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
