    "text": "Authority; Land Use: Home Garden, Water Tank & Two Permanent Buildings; Extent : 0.1074 Hectare. All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Walapane Divisional Secretariat on the 28 day of February 2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 14 day of February 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. I.M. Senanayaka, Divisional Secretary, Walapane.",
